just wanted to clear up some ... uhh ... misconceptions, not that you
intended any or anything ...

a katana is a type of long sword (in reality) but is a separate weapon
distinct from a long sword in the dungeon.  a wakizashi is identical
to a short sword just named differently (one might even consider
short sword to be the "english" name for a wakizashi).

engraving with bladed weapons will eventually make them dull and useless
unless, of course, that weapon is a not cursed athame.

